WEBVTT

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:42.660
"Early yesterday morning my father, Tousana Jone, passed away due to heart disease."

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:49.460
Dad...

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.030
Erin!

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:23.490
Yuuyan!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:25.200
I'm back!

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:29.710
Welcome back!

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.750
Here, a souvenir for you.

00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:34.550
A beast-lord?

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.590
Yup.  It's a beast-lord's mask.

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:38.430
I thought you'd like it.

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:40.140
Thank you, Yuuyan!

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.350
But you surprised me.

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:43.890
You never told me that you were coming back today.

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.520
Looks like you're doing well, Erin.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.520
Yes!  And you, too.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.110
You really are fine, right?

00:02:57.490 --> 00:03:02.740
I heard your foster father passed away, so I was worried.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.580
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:12.380
I feel like I have to get myself together fast so Oji-san won't be worried.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.170
Yes, I'm sure you'll do just fine!

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:27.640
Beast's Fang

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.440
Wow, wow.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:39.150
Lilan-chan looks pathetic.

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:41.320
Don't say it like that.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:47.790
Once all the down comes off, she'll become a fine lady.

00:03:48.580 --> 00:03:51.540
"Lady?"  So Lilan's a girl?

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:55.420
Yup, I just found out recently.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:59.630
Really?  Then we've got another addition to the Kazalm girls' team!

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:01.010
Yup, exactly!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:12.440
Boy, oh boy.  She'll get covered in leaves if she does that.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.690
Maybe where the fur's changing itches.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:25.620
I know!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.700
A brush?

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.540
Erin, what are you thinking of doing?

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.130
I can't leave Lilan like that.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:42.090
Stop that!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:44.510
Lilan, behave yourself a little.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:49.060
I can't believe that a beast-lord would act so friendly.

00:04:49.060 --> 00:04:51.140
It's almost like a dog or a cat.

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:55.100
I'll groom you with this, so be still, all right?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:09.290
Does it feel good?

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.250
Wow.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:25.130
Erin!  Isn't the brush too small?

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:28.050
At that rate, the sun's gonna set.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:30.810
You're right.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:38.940
It's Erin.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:41.860
She's holding a horse brush.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.530
Where is she going with that?

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:48.370
Can't you tell by the look on her face?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.080
You're right.

00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.450
As always.

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:54.080
Beast-lord gung-ho.

00:05:54.460 --> 00:05:56.210
Nukku-san!  Mokku-san!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.300
You want a brush bigger than that?

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:06.260
Yes.  Beast-lords are big, so I need something bigger.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.430
Can you make one?

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:12.680
Leave it to me!  If it's <i>your</i> wish, I'd grant it even if I couldn't!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:13.810
Yeah, yeah!

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:15.480
Thank you very much!

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:27.110
These animals function as a pack to protect their children, immediate family, and the pack itself.

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:35.700
It's also to catch their food, but the strongest becomes the leader of the pack to protect everyone.

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:39.920
The orders of the leader are absolute.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.210
Excuse me, but is that true with beast-lords, too?

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:48.930
To be honest, the beast-lords' social structure is still unknown.

00:06:53.060 --> 00:06:58.890
"The strongest becomes the leader of the pack to protect everyone."

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:05.280
"The orders of the leader are absolute," huh?

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:13.660
Since I'm Lilan's mother right now, I have to get my act together.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.920
Sorry for the wait.  Here it is, made to order.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.880
I'm the one who made it.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.420
Thank you very much, Mokku-san.

00:07:28.420 --> 00:07:32.140
You're really good at making things, Mokku-san.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.510
I helped out, too!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:37.020
You only kept breaking things.

00:07:37.020 --> 00:07:38.770
You weren't supposed to say that.

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.150
Can she really carry that by herself?

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:41.810
Hey, check that out.
Can she really carry that by herself?

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:42.650
Hey, check that out.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:44.440
Is she going to be all right?

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.320
Sit down, Lilan.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.350
Good girl.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.680
Wow.

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.320
Erin!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:12.950
Don't blow it!

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:18.080
Don't blow it no matter what!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.080
Lilan was just a little surprised.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.500
Lilan didn't mean to hurt me.

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.920
She was just a little surprised.

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.770
Esal-sensei...

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:32.110
Really.  How stupid of you.

00:10:32.110 --> 00:10:34.110
Three stitches on your earlobe.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.570
And eight stitches on your shoulder, you know?

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:44.790
Hey, don't move so suddenly like that!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.750
I'm sorry.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:58.430
You might have thought you were special since you became close to Lilan,

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:02.890
but because of that, it looks like you became oblivious to the apparent danger.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:08.060
I'm partly at fault for trusting you too much.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:12.020
Don't try to touch Lilan anymore.

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:19.450
That's something... I <i>won't</i> do.

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:26.500
Whether you like it or not, no means no.

00:11:26.500 --> 00:11:28.040
You almost died!

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.580
I know!

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.210
I won't let my guard down again.

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:35.380
Lilan thinks of me as a mother.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:40.930
If I keep my distance from Lilan now, she might return to her original state.

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.050
You're dreaming!

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:47.520
Beasts only listen to others when they believe the one speaking is stronger.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:51.310
Beast-lords are different from us humans.  They're beasts.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.690
A mute whistle...

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:04.490
This is the only means humans have to prove that they are at an advantage over beast-lords.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:10.410
If you think you're Lilan's mother, then use this to make Lilan obey you.

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:15.130
It's not love that makes beast-lords listen to you.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.170
It's fear.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.710
Understand?

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:25.600
Otherwise, don't think that you'll get away with only an injury next time.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.810
I swore never to use it.

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:37.650
In that case, write a will.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.820
Write that it was your stupidity which caused your death.

00:12:41.820 --> 00:12:43.450
You bring it upon yourself.

00:12:45.370 --> 00:12:50.870
Hand it in to me, so there will be no problems.

00:13:00.210 --> 00:13:01.800
<i>Write a will.</i>

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.970
Erin, are you all right?

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:11.850
We were worried what would happen to you there.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:13.770
We're glad to see you're fine.

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.100
I was so surprised.

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.560
It was tough taking you out, you know?

00:13:17.560 --> 00:13:20.360
Tell us if you need any help.

00:13:21.740 --> 00:13:23.650
Yeah, thank you.

00:13:24.110 --> 00:13:25.530
But I'm fine now.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.410
I'm really sorry for worrying you all.

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:40.920
<i>The strongest becomes the leader of the pack to protect everyone.</i>

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:45.300
<i>The orders of the leader are absolute.</i>

00:14:14.710 --> 00:14:15.710
<i>Erin.</i>

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.380
<i>Tocchi and Noro are like your family.</i>

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:26.720
<i>But if they are stung by a bee, panic, and kick you, they might kill you.</i>

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:31.220
<i>Erin.</i>

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:36.480
<i>Touda are different from us humans.  They're beasts.</i>

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.980
<i>Don't forget that.</i>

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.800
Was I mistaken?

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:11.140
Can beast-lords and humans really not come to an understanding?

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:12.990
Ready?

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:53.990
Did something happen?

00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:56.070
I thought you went to check up on Lilan.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.620
You haven't seen her?

00:16:58.620 --> 00:16:59.620
No.

00:16:59.620 --> 00:17:00.290
Why not?

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:06.420
I couldn't bring myself to open the doors of the shed.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:09.630
I can understand after what happened.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:14.430
You should leave Lilan to Esal-sensei and the others for a while.

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.530
Oh darn.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:37.120
It went into our room.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.870
I'll go get it.

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.770
Our harp...

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:34.360
Lilan!

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:46.050
Beast-lords are beast-lords.

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:57.020
As Esal-sensei says, it might be fear that beasts feel toward humans, and not love.

00:20:58.070 --> 00:21:04.740
But is that really the only kind of relationship we can create?

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:18.130
To obey humans, because they fear us...
Is fear really the only thing between humans and beasts?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:27.220
I want to find that answer one day.

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:34.480
Even if it means taking the same path my mother took.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:49.740
Lilan.

00:21:50.290 --> 00:21:52.450
I'm sorry I left you alone.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:05.930
Lilan.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:14.640
Erin confronted Lilan once again.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:23.280
And she also holds onto her wish to come to a real understanding with Lilan.

00:24:02.000 --> 00:24:04.090
Erin is now eighteen.

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:08.930
At first, she had trouble getting used to boarding life,

00:24:08.930 --> 00:24:12.460
but now, she's a living role model of a college student.

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:15.670
She has befriended a beast-lord against all precedents,

00:24:15.670 --> 00:24:18.070
and is raising her without using benetrophic water.

00:24:18.590 --> 00:24:21.760
It really was four years filled with surprises.

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:24.920
Kemono no Souja Erin.  The Fourth Winter.

00:24:25.090 --> 00:24:30.070
The Fourth Winter
